{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"HydroForecast Ituango API","description":"API operativa para el pronóstico de caudal Estación Olaya — Río Cauca","version":"1.1.0"},"paths":{"/api/diag":{"get":{"summary":" Diagnostics","operationId":"_diagnostics_api_diag_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/diag/persist_now":{"post":{"summary":" Diag Persist Now","description":"Fuerza una subida inmediata del snapshot más reciente al dataset\n(para verificación; en operación normal ocurre cada 3 h).","operationId":"_diag_persist_now_api_diag_persist_now_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/diag/run":{"post":{"summary":" Diag Run Pipeline","operationId":"_diag_run_pipeline_api_diag_run_post","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/health":{"get":{"summary":"Health","description":"Salud del sistema. Cada llamada también dispara (si corresponde) un\npipeline completo en background (pull GitHub → enriched → predict).","operationId":"health_api_health_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/hourly":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Hourly","operationId":"forecast_hourly_api_forecast_hourly_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/precipitation/pluviometros":{"get":{"summary":"Precipitation Pluviometros","description":"Lluvia caida en los 5 pluviometros de EPM que llegan por el relay (29-oct-2026, auditoria UX: el v2p los usa\ndesde el 27-oct y la app solo los mencionaba en la tarjeta de 24 h). Acumulados 6 h / 24 h / 72 h / 7 d (None si\nfalta mas del 30 % de la ventana), serie horaria y diaria. Cache 5 min.","operationId":"precipitation_pluviometros_api_precipitation_pluviometros_get","parameters":[{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":14,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/horizon":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast 15Min","operationId":"forecast_15min_api_forecast_horizon_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/daily":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Daily","description":"Pronóstico diario: HOY + 3 días siguientes = 4 días.\nSlice del tren consistente: ML día 1 + SARIMA días 2-4.\nCae a `daily_3d` legacy si el nuevo `daily_4d` no existe en el JSON.","operationId":"forecast_daily_api_forecast_daily_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/weekly":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Weekly","operationId":"forecast_weekly_api_forecast_weekly_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/weekly7d":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Weekly7D","description":"Vista operativa: 7 días siguientes con promedio diario de Olaya y Sitio Presa.","operationId":"forecast_weekly7d_api_forecast_weekly7d_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/horizon":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Horizon","description":"Pronóstico CaudalPintada a 24 h (96 pasos × 15 min), modelo LightGBM MVP.","operationId":"forecast_pintada_horizon_api_forecast_pintada_horizon_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/hourly":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Hourly","operationId":"forecast_pintada_hourly_api_forecast_pintada_hourly_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/daily":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Daily","description":"Pronóstico diario Pintada: HOY + 3 días. Slice del tren consistente Pintada.","operationId":"forecast_pintada_daily_api_forecast_pintada_daily_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/weekly7d":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Weekly7D","operationId":"forecast_pintada_weekly7d_api_forecast_pintada_weekly7d_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/monthly_trend":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Monthly","operationId":"forecast_pintada_monthly_api_forecast_pintada_monthly_trend_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/quincenal_15d":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Quincenal","operationId":"forecast_pintada_quincenal_api_forecast_pintada_quincenal_15d_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/quarterly_outlook":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Quarterly","operationId":"forecast_pintada_quarterly_api_forecast_pintada_quarterly_outlook_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/annual_365d":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Annual","operationId":"forecast_pintada_annual_api_forecast_pintada_annual_365d_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/pintada/explanation":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Pintada Explanation","operationId":"forecast_pintada_explanation_api_forecast_pintada_explanation_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/alerts/pintada/thresholds":{"get":{"summary":"Alerts Pintada Thresholds","operationId":"alerts_pintada_thresholds_api_alerts_pintada_thresholds_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/alerts/pintada":{"get":{"summary":"Alerts Pintada","operationId":"alerts_pintada_api_alerts_pintada_get","parameters":[{"name":"umbral_caudal_m3s","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Umbral Caudal M3S"}},{"name":"umbral_crecida_m3s","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Umbral Crecida M3S"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/monthly_trend":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Monthly Trend","description":"Tendencia mensual: 30 días siguientes vía SARIMA-Fourier extendido.\n\nSkill decae con el horizonte; usar como indicador de tendencia, no como\npronóstico point-skill.","operationId":"forecast_monthly_trend_api_forecast_monthly_trend_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/quincenal_15d":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Quincenal 15D","description":"Proyección quincenal (15 días) Olaya. Slice del tren consistente.","operationId":"forecast_quincenal_15d_api_forecast_quincenal_15d_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/quarterly_outlook":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Quarterly Outlook","description":"Outlook trimestral (90 días) Olaya. Slice del tren consistente:\nML día 1 + SARIMA días 2-15 + damping días 16-90.","operationId":"forecast_quarterly_outlook_api_forecast_quarterly_outlook_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/annual_365d":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Annual 365D","description":"Pronóstico anual (365 días) Olaya. Desde el dia 8, climatologia del dia del anio + anomalia\nreciente del rio que se desvanece (tau 120 d, 360 d si NMME anuncia El Nino/La Nina): `largo`.","operationId":"forecast_annual_365d_api_forecast_annual_365d_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/observed":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Observed","description":"Devuelve los valores OBSERVADOS más recientes de Olaya y Sitio Presa\n(últimas `hours` horas), leyendo directamente del histórico enriquecido.\n\nEsta serie se actualiza con cada nueva ingesta del CSV fuente,\nindependientemente de cuándo se ejecutó el último pronóstico.","operationId":"forecast_observed_api_forecast_observed_get","parameters":[{"name":"hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":168,"minimum":1,"default":24,"title":"Hours"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/observed/daily":{"get":{"summary":"Observed Daily","description":"Promedios DIARIOS observados de las últimas `days` jornadas (incluye HOY\nsi hay datos parciales). Sirve para el panel de trazabilidad en charts\ndiarios/semanal/quincenal/mensual/trimestral/anual donde se muestra obs\nvs pred-histórico antes de la fecha actual.","operationId":"observed_daily_api_observed_daily_get","parameters":[{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":400,"minimum":1,"default":30,"title":"Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/observed/current":{"get":{"summary":"Observed Current","description":"Devuelve el último valor OBSERVADO no-NaN para cada variable, con timestamp.\nPensado para los KPI cards (auto-actualizable a cada refresh).","operationId":"observed_current_api_observed_current_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/explanation":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast Explanation","operationId":"forecast_explanation_api_forecast_explanation_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/historical":{"get":{"summary":"Historical","operationId":"historical_api_historical_get","parameters":[{"name":"hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":720,"minimum":1,"default":72,"title":"Hours"}},{"name":"desde","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"YYYY-MM-DD (descarga por rango)","title":"Desde"},"description":"YYYY-MM-DD (descarga por rango)"},{"name":"hasta","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}],"description":"YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive","title":"Hasta"},"description":"YYYY-MM-DD, inclusive"}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/enso/pronostico":{"get":{"summary":"Enso Pronostico","description":"Pronostico de ENSO para el panel de la app (18-oct-2026): CFSv2 de NOAA CPC (40 miembros, Nino 3.4\nabsoluto y relativo) + ONI y RONI observados. Cache 6 h; ver ml/src/data/enso_pronostico.py.","operationId":"enso_pronostico_api_enso_pronostico_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/precipitation/modelo":{"get":{"summary":"Precipitation Modelo","description":"Lluvia pronosticada que USA el modelo semanal (19-oct-2026, auditoria UX: la app mostraba solo GFS\nde Open-Meteo, que el modelo no usa). Ultima corrida WRF de IDEAM (00Z, dias locales 1-7) y ultima\nemision CHIRPS-GEFS (dias 0-8), mm/dia promedio por zona, desde la cache que llena el refresh\n(ml/data/cache/lluvia_externa).","operationId":"precipitation_modelo_api_precipitation_modelo_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/climate/indices":{"get":{"summary":"Climate Indices","description":"Devuelve estado actual de ENSO (ONI NOAA) y MJO (RMM BoM si está disponible).\nCaché 24h para no golpear NOAA en cada request.\n\nEstructura:\n  {\n    \"oni\": {\"latest\": {\"date\", \"oni\", \"phase\"}, \"history_monthly\": [...], \"source\": ...},\n    \"mjo\": {\"latest\": {\"date\", \"rmm1\", \"rmm2\", \"phase\", \"amplitude\"}, ...} | null,\n    \"_cache_status\": \"fresh\" | \"stale_fallback\" | \"refreshed\" | \"error_fallback\"\n  }\n\nRobustez: este endpoint NUNCA debe devolver 500. Si el fetch a NOAA/BoM\nfalla y no hay caché previa, devuelve `oni=None, mjo=None` con\n`_cache_status=\"error_fallback\"`. El frontend muestra \"no disponible\" en\nlugar de un alarmante HTTP 500.","operationId":"climate_indices_api_climate_indices_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/historical/stats":{"get":{"summary":"Historical Stats","description":"Estadísticas (mean, median, std, n) sobre toda la serie histórica enriquecida,\npara las variables de caudal usadas en los gráficos. Excluye nulos.\n\nDevuelve también `range`: la fecha mínima y máxima cubiertas, útil para mostrar\nen la UI la cobertura temporal de las estadísticas.","operationId":"historical_stats_api_historical_stats_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/history":{"get":{"summary":"Forecast History","description":"Devuelve `n` forecasts pasados ESPACIADOS uniformemente (cada\n`spacing_hours` horas) dentro de `lookback_days` días, para mostrar\nevolución de las predicciones en cada chart del dashboard.\n\nCada forecast pasado incluye sus slices operacionales (daily_4d,\nweekly_7d, quincenal_15d, monthly_trend_30d, quarterly_outlook_90d,\ny annual head(90)) — sin horizon_15min para mantener el payload bajo 1 MB.\n\nAlgoritmo de selección (greedy):\n  1) Filtrar archivos dentro de `lookback_days`\n  2) Empezando por el más antiguo del rango, escoger el siguiente\n     archivo cuyo origin >= último_seleccionado + spacing_hours\n  3) Cortar a `n` archivos\n\nEsto garantiza que los pasados elegidos están bien separados (no\nconsecutivos a 15 min entre sí, que es la cadencia del re-pronóstico\nautomático).","operationId":"forecast_history_api_forecast_history_get","parameters":[{"name":"station","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(olaya|pintada)$","default":"olaya","title":"Station"}},{"name":"n","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":20,"minimum":1,"default":5,"title":"N"}},{"name":"spacing_hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number","maximum":168.0,"minimum":0.25,"default":24.0,"title":"Spacing Hours"}},{"name":"lookback_days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":60,"minimum":1,"default":14,"title":"Lookback Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/historical_predictions":{"get":{"summary":"Historical Predictions","description":"Endpoint SWR de la serie histórica de predicciones.\n\nSi hay CUALQUIER resultado cacheado (aunque esté vencido) se sirve al instante\ny, si venció, se recomputa en SEGUNDO PLANO. Así el endpoint NUNCA bloquea bajo\nuna request cuando el _HIST_PRED_CACHE expira DURANTE un refresh: el recómputo\ninline (que recarga el enriquecido ~400k filas que el refresh reescribe cada\nciclo, con los cores saturados por SARIMA) se starveaba a 15-60s → la ráfaga\nconcurrente del navegador expiraba → \"no aparece el histórico de pronósticos\".\nSólo la PRIMERÍSIMA vez (sin cache alguna) se computa bajo la request; el\nwarming la precalienta al arrancar y tras cada refresh.","operationId":"historical_predictions_api_historical_predictions_get","parameters":[{"name":"station","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(olaya|pintada)$","default":"olaya","title":"Station"}},{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":400,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Days"}},{"name":"granularity","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","pattern":"^(daily|fifteen_min)$","default":"daily","title":"Granularity"}},{"name":"smooth","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"OPT-IN: rolling-mean 3 puntos. Modifica valores — solo si te conviene visualmente.","default":false,"title":"Smooth"},"description":"OPT-IN: rolling-mean 3 puntos. Modifica valores — solo si te conviene visualmente."},{"name":"interpolate","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"OPT-IN: interpolación lineal de huecos. Inventa valores que el modelo no produjo.","default":false,"title":"Interpolate"},"description":"OPT-IN: interpolación lineal de huecos. Inventa valores que el modelo no produjo."},{"name":"bias_align","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"boolean","description":"OPT-IN: resta bias medio (pred − obs) reciente. Útil para comparación visual pero no es lo que el modelo dijo.","default":false,"title":"Bias Align"},"description":"OPT-IN: resta bias medio (pred − obs) reciente. Útil para comparación visual pero no es lo que el modelo dijo."}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/climatology/daily":{"get":{"summary":"Climatology Daily","description":"Climatología diaria por Day-Of-Year (DOY 1..366) sobre toda la serie\nhistórica enriquecida. Para cada variable y cada DOY devuelve\n`mean / median / std / p10 / p25 / p75 / p90 / n`.\n\nPensado para alimentar las series sinusoidales (en lugar de líneas\nhorizontales constantes) en los charts de pronóstico: el frontend\ncruza por DOY con los timestamps del chart y obtiene la climatología\nestacional como serie.\n\nCaché en módulo con invalidación por mtime del parquet (igual patrón\nque _get_enriched_cached).","operationId":"climatology_daily_api_climatology_daily_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/models/metrics":{"get":{"summary":"Models Metrics","operationId":"models_metrics_api_models_metrics_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/alerts/thresholds":{"get":{"summary":"Alerts Thresholds","description":"Devuelve los umbrales operativos calculados con el método IQR (Tukey)\nsobre el histórico completo de CaudalOlaya. Incluye Q1, Q3, IQR y\npercentiles auxiliares para que el frontend explique al usuario cómo\nse calcularon.","operationId":"alerts_thresholds_api_alerts_thresholds_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/alerts":{"get":{"summary":"Alerts","description":"Si los umbrales no se pasan como query params, se computan dinámicamente\nvía IQR del histórico de Olaya (ver /api/alerts/thresholds).","operationId":"alerts_api_alerts_get","parameters":[{"name":"umbral_caudal_m3s","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Umbral Caudal M3S"}},{"name":"umbral_crecida_m3s","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"anyOf":[{"type":"number"},{"type":"null"}],"title":"Umbral Crecida M3S"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/estado":{"get":{"summary":"Estado","description":"Nivel unico (normal/vigilancia/atencion/crecida), motivos y resumen en lenguaje operativo.","operationId":"estado_api_estado_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/aguas_arriba":{"get":{"summary":"Aguas Arriba","description":"Caudal horario en vivo de La Virginia -> La Pintada -> Bolombolo -> Olaya, con el cambio\nreciente de cada estacion y su tiempo de viaje aproximado hasta Olaya.","operationId":"aguas_arriba_api_aguas_arriba_get","parameters":[{"name":"hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":720,"minimum":6,"default":72,"title":"Hours"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/seguimiento":{"get":{"summary":"Seguimiento","description":"Desempeno en vivo: comparacion con Hidrometria (solo donde exista el resumen, generado en el\nservidor local con los CSV de Hidrometria), informe de crecientes de los lunes y estado de los\nmodelos (reentrenos y archivo de ensambles).","operationId":"seguimiento_api_seguimiento_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/retrain":{"post":{"summary":"Retrain","operationId":"retrain_api_retrain_post","parameters":[{"name":"x-api-key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"X-Api-Key"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/forecast/run":{"post":{"summary":"Trigger Forecast","operationId":"trigger_forecast_api_forecast_run_post","parameters":[{"name":"x-api-key","in":"header","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","title":"X-Api-Key"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/quality/operational":{"get":{"summary":"Quality Operational","description":"Calidad operacional del pronóstico Olaya. Compara los archivos\nforecast_*.json acumulados contra el observado CaudalOlaya del enriquecido.\n\nImplementación optimizada: usa caché del parquet + filtro de filename\n+ merge vectorizado para evitar timeouts cuando hay muchos forecasts\nacumulados.","operationId":"quality_operational_api_quality_operational_get","parameters":[{"name":"window_days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":90,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Window Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/quality/pintada/operational":{"get":{"summary":"Quality Pintada Operational","description":"Calidad operacional del pronóstico Pintada (compara forecast_pintada_*.json\nvs CaudalPintada observado en el master).","operationId":"quality_pintada_operational_api_quality_pintada_operational_get","parameters":[{"name":"window_days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":90,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Window Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/quality/by_lead":{"get":{"summary":"Quality By Lead","description":"Calidad de Olaya desglosada por lead time, velocidad del rio y error del pico.","operationId":"quality_by_lead_api_quality_by_lead_get","parameters":[{"name":"window_days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":90,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Window Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/quality/pintada/by_lead":{"get":{"summary":"Quality Pintada By Lead","description":"Calidad de Pintada desglosada por lead time, velocidad del rio y error del pico.","operationId":"quality_pintada_by_lead_api_quality_pintada_by_lead_get","parameters":[{"name":"window_days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":90,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Window Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/historical_predictions/by_lead":{"get":{"summary":"Historical Predictions By Lead","description":"Serie historica de pronostico servida a un lead DECLARADO y consistente.\n\nA diferencia de /api/historical_predictions (\"gana el origen mas nuevo\",\nlead efectivo variable de 0 a 3 h), aqui cada punto proviene del pronostico\nemitido aproximadamente `lead_hours` horas antes de ese instante.","operationId":"historical_predictions_by_lead_api_historical_predictions_by_lead_get","parameters":[{"name":"station","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"olaya","title":"Station"}},{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":90,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Days"}},{"name":"lead_hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number","maximum":24.0,"minimum":0.25,"default":6.0,"title":"Lead Hours"}},{"name":"tolerance_hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number","maximum":6.0,"minimum":0.25,"default":1.5,"title":"Tolerance Hours"}},{"name":"granularity","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"fifteen_min","title":"Granularity"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/hidrometria/por_antelacion":{"get":{"summary":"Hidrometria Por Antelacion","description":"Ver _calc_hidrometria_por_antelacion. 27-oct-2026: stale-while-revalidate mientras no cambien los\narchivos de Hidrometria (firma); si cambian, se recalcula bajo la peticion.","operationId":"hidrometria_por_antelacion_api_hidrometria_por_antelacion_get","parameters":[{"name":"days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":30,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Days"}},{"name":"lead_hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number","maximum":24.0,"minimum":0.25,"default":6.0,"title":"Lead Hours"}},{"name":"station","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"string","default":"olaya","title":"Station"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/rainfall/stations":{"get":{"summary":"Rainfall Stations","description":"Devuelve las coordenadas de las 4 estaciones de lluvia DHIME + estadísticas\nrecientes (acumulado en window_hours horas y último valor) para alimentar\nel mapa con polígonos de Thiessen / IDW.","operationId":"rainfall_stations_api_rainfall_stations_get","parameters":[{"name":"window_hours","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":720,"minimum":1,"default":72,"title":"Window Hours"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/rainfall/multi_annual_mean":{"get":{"summary":"Rainfall Multi Annual Mean","description":"Calcula la precipitación media multianual por estación DHIME y construye:\n- polígonos de Thiessen (Voronoi) coloreados por media multianual\n- grilla IDW (grid_size × grid_size) sobre el bbox de la cuenca\n- isoyetas (líneas de contorno) extraídas de la grilla IDW\n\nMedia multianual = promedio del total anual (suma de precipitación diaria\npor año) sobre los años con al menos 300 días registrados.","operationId":"rainfall_multi_annual_mean_api_rainfall_multi_annual_mean_get","parameters":[{"name":"grid_size","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":120,"minimum":10,"default":40,"title":"Grid Size"}},{"name":"n_isolines","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":20,"minimum":3,"default":8,"title":"N Isolines"}},{"name":"idw_power","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"number","maximum":4.0,"minimum":1.0,"default":2.0,"title":"Idw Power"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/precipitation/ideam":{"get":{"summary":"Precipitation Ideam","description":"Precipitación observada IDEAM (NRT) de estaciones de la cuenca.","operationId":"precipitation_ideam_api_precipitation_ideam_get","parameters":[{"name":"hours_back","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":120,"minimum":1,"default":24,"title":"Hours Back"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/precipitation/gfs":{"get":{"summary":"Precipitation Gfs","description":"Pronóstico de precipitación GFS para las zonas de la cuenca.","operationId":"precipitation_gfs_api_precipitation_gfs_get","parameters":[{"name":"forecast_days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":16,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Forecast Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/precipitation/context":{"get":{"summary":"Precipitation Context","description":"Contexto combinado de precipitación IDEAM + GFS para el dashboard.","operationId":"precipitation_context_api_precipitation_context_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/enso/state":{"get":{"summary":"Enso State","description":"Estado ENSO monitoreado y su historial de cambios.\n\nEl `refresh_cycle` comprueba el ONI en cada ciclo (cacheado 24 h, el índice\nse publica una vez al mes) y registra aquí los cambios materiales: cambio de\nfase, cruce del umbral de evento (±0.5) o salto del ONI >= 0.5. Cuando eso\nocurre, el pronóstico de largo plazo de ese mismo ciclo ya se recalcula con\nel perfil de habilidad reestimado sobre el registro actualizado.","operationId":"enso_state_api_enso_state_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/enso/skill":{"get":{"summary":"Enso Skill","description":"Perfil de habilidad ENSO→caudal por horizonte, con R² fuera de muestra.\n\nEs la base estadística de la modulación de largo plazo: para cada horizonte\nL (meses) se ajusta log-anomalía(t+L) ~ β(L)·ONI(t) y se valida con ventana\nexpansiva. Se expone para que el operador vea CUÁNTA confianza merece la\nproyección a cada plazo, en vez de suponerla uniforme.","operationId":"enso_skill_api_enso_skill_get","responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}}}}},"/api/precipitation/ideam/timeseries":{"get":{"summary":"Precipitation Ideam Timeseries","description":"Series de tiempo de precipitación IDEAM NRT, agrupadas por hora y municipio.","operationId":"precipitation_ideam_timeseries_api_precipitation_ideam_timeseries_get","parameters":[{"name":"hours_back","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":120,"minimum":1,"default":48,"title":"Hours Back"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description":"Validation Error","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"}}}}}}},"/api/precipitation/gfs/timeseries":{"get":{"summary":"Precipitation Gfs Timeseries","description":"Series de tiempo horarias de precipitación GFS por zona.","operationId":"precipitation_gfs_timeseries_api_precipitation_gfs_timeseries_get","parameters":[{"name":"forecast_days","in":"query","required":false,"schema":{"type":"integer","maximum":16,"minimum":1,"default":7,"title":"Forecast Days"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"Successful Response","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{}}}},"422":{"description